{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202500","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202500","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1120250001:1":{"text":"잠깐만요! 쿠긴 씨! 여긴 블랙하울 영지와 너무 먼데... 여기까지 배웅할 필요가…","source_cn":"等等！库金，你送得太远了！这里距离黑嚎的领地……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CD80F8B1950B410","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120250002:2":{"text":"사실… 난 이제 블랙하울로 돌아가지 않을 생각이다.","source_cn":"其实……我已经不打算回黑嚎了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80BAEB920CA3491B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120250003:1":{"text":"크루거와도 이야기를 마쳤어. 난 오늘부로 블랙하울을 떠날 거야.","source_cn":"我和克鲁格说过了，从今天开始，我会离开黑嚎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB84CC897B16CCC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120250004:1":{"text":"이제부터 난 내 힘으로 새로운 부족을 만들 거고, 그들과 함께 정상을 향해 나아갈 생각이야.","source_cn":"接下来，我会依靠自己的力量，建立全新的氏族，然后带领我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAE27D566FCC0B7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120250005:1":{"text":"너희가 그랬던 것처럼.","source_cn":"就像你们过去曾经做到的那样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20A8FDF9F0BC5577","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120250006:1":{"text":"소렌, 언젠가는 내 부족도 우르 부족이 그랬던 것처럼 모두의 존중과 인정을 받는 날이 올 거다.","source_cn":"索恩，总有一天，我的部落会像乌尔氏族一样，得到所有人的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4C5CDF25A05F7F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120250007:1":{"text":"그래, 그런 날이 오기를 바랄게. 그리고…","source_cn":"那就祝福你吧……希望——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x129CFCBF41640F00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120250008:1":{"text":"다음 번 군가 축제에서 볼 수 있었으면 좋겠군.","source_cn":"下一次的战歌节上能见到你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA76143028238AE62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120250009:1":{"text":"물론이지, 그땐 지금까지의 패배를 전부 갚아주마.","source_cn":"当然。到那时候，我会把之前输掉的都赢回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC20F13F00BFF20FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120250010:1":{"text":"기다리고 있을게.","source_cn":"那我就等着看了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FF68DB3166CFF20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:库金":{"text":"쿠긴","source":"库金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":3}}